{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03849","headline":"赠封御史入台 · 苏味道","name":"赠封御史入台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故事推三独，兹辰对两闱。\n夕鸦共鸣舞，屈草接芳菲。\n盛府持清橐，殊章动绣衣。\n风连台阁起，霜就简书飞。\n凛凛当朝色，行行满路威。\n惟当击隼去，复覩落鵰归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏味道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}